 ,\nL94: \nL95: [Button: Yuguang Chen] ,\nL96: \nL97: [Button: Jing Li]\nL98: \nL99: +78 authors\nL100: ## Abstract\nL101: \nL102: Hunyuan3D Studio automates 3D asset creation using AI, integrating neural modules to transform concept images or text into high-quality, game-ready 3D models with optimized geometry and PBR textures.\nL103: \nL104: Generated by cite32†Qwen/Qwen2.5-Coder-32B-Instruct L105: The creation of high-quality 3D assets, a cornerstone of modern game development, has long been characterized by labor-intensive and specialized workflows. This paper presents Hunyuan3D Studio, an end-to-end AI-powered content creation platform designed to revolutionize the game production pipeline by automating and streamlining the generation of game-ready 3D assets.\nL106: At its core, Hunyuan3D Studio integrates a suite of advanced neural modules (such as cite33†Part-level 3D Generation , cite34†Polygon Generation , cite35†Semantic UV , etc.) into a cohesive and user-friendly system. This unified framework allows for the rapid transformation of a single concept image or textual description into a fully-realized, production-quality 3D model complete with optimized geometry and high-fidelity cite36†PBR textures .\nL107: We demonstrate that assets generated by Hunyuan3D Studio are not only visually compelling but also adhere to the stringent technical requirements of contemporary game engines, significantly reducing iteration time and lowering the barrier to entry for 3D content creation. By providing a seamless bridge from creative intent to technical asset, Hunyuan3D Studio represents a significant leap forward for AI-assisted workflows in game development and interactive media.\nL108: cite37†View arXiv page†arxiv.org cite38†View PDF†arxiv.org cite39†Project page†3d.hunyuan.tencent.com cite27†Add to collection L109: ### Community\nL110: \nL111: cite40†Image†cdn-avatars.huggingface.co L112: \nL113: cite26†taesiri L114: \nL115: Paper submitter cite41†Sep 17, 2025 L116: The creation of high-quality 3D assets, a cornerstone of modern game development, has long been characterized by labor-intensive and specialized workflows. This paper presents Hunyuan3D Studio, an end-to-end AI-powered content creation platform designed to revolutionize the game production pipeline by automating and streamlining the generation of game-ready 3D assets.\nL117: At its core, Hunyuan3D Studio integrates a suite of advanced neural modules (such as Part-level 3D Generation, Polygon Generation, Semantic UV, etc.) into a cohesive and user-friendly system. This unified framework allows for the rapid transformation of a single concept image or textual description into a fully-realized, production-quality 3D model complete with optimized geometry and high-fidelity PBR textures.\nL118: We demonstrate that assets generated by Hunyuan3D Studio are not only visually compelling but also adhere to the stringent technical requirements of contemporary game engines, significantly reducing iteration time and lowering the barrier to entry for 3D content creation. By providing a seamless bridge from creative intent to technical asset, Hunyuan3D Studio represents a significant leap forward for AI-assisted workflows in game development and interactive media.\nL119: Reply\nL120: \nL121: cite42†Image†cdn-avatars.huggingface.co L122: \nL123: cite43†librarian-bot L124: \nL125: cite44†Sep 18, 2025 L126: \nL127: This is an automated message from the cite45†Librarian Bot . I found the following papers similar to this paper.\nL128: \nL129: The following papers were recommended by the Semantic Scholar API\nL130:   * cite46†BANG: Dividing 3D Assets via Generative Exploded Dynamics (2025)\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPaper page - Single-stream Policy Optimization (https://huggingface.co/papers/2509.13232)\nciteturn3253view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: yesterday; Content type: text/ht